## Examples

- [feed-farmer-pwa](https://github.com/escape-llc/feed-farmer-pwa): a real RSS/Atom feed reader PWA, fully client-side, built entirely with toolcrib ([live demo](https://escape-llc.github.io/feed-farmer-pwa/))
- [founders-desk](https://github.com/escape-llc/founders-desk): a personal command-center PWA, fully client-side, built entirely with toolcrib ([live demo](https://escape-llc.github.io/founders-desk/))

